\subsection{Method \code{requiredMethods()}}{
Lists the method names that any class claiming conformance to this protocol
must implement. Specifically, classes conforming to \code{RSMutableCopying}
are required to define a method called \code{mutableCopy}, which returns a
mutable (deep) copy of the object.
